<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>46K — Decoding Football Intelligence</title><meta name="description" content="Decoding football intelligence. Understanding, assessing and developing the cognitive side of football."/></head><body>
<header><a href="/" class="mark" aria-label="46K home">46K</a><nav><a href="/explore/">Explore</a><a href="/assessment/">Assessment</a><a href="/mission/">The 2046 Mission</a><a href="/connect/">Connect</a></nav></header>
<main><section class="hero"><div class="eyebrow">46K / FOOTBALL INTELLIGENCE / SWEDEN</div><span class="rule"></span><h1>The game<br/>is played<br/><em>up here.</em></h1><p class="lead">Talent is more than what you can see today. We explore the cognitive side of football — what it is, how to assess it, and how it might be developed.</p><a class="cta" href="/explore/">Explore our thinking ↗</a><div class="index">DECODING FOOTBALL INTELLIGENCE <span>01 — 03</span></div></section>
<section class="features"><div class="eyebrow">A WAY OF THINKING</div><div class="feature-grid">{features.map(f=><article><h2>{f.name}</h2><p>{f.body}</p><a href={f.href}>Discover ↗</a></article>)}</div></section>
<section class="mission"><div class="eyebrow">THE 2046 MISSION</div><h2>What if Sweden could see the talent it's currently missing?</h2><p>2046 is not a prediction. It is a direction.</p><a href="/mission/">Discover the mission ↗</a></section></main><footer><span>46K · DECODING FOOTBALL INTELLIGENCE</span><span>SWEDEN / 2046</span></footer>
</body></html>
